lm in crisis, makes correct decisions quickly, understands complicated technology. Also concerns: difficulty communicating ideas, egocentric, not willing to further education.\n\nWe need to compare with B: B very conscientious, handles stress well, good at assessing weather, excellent computer skills, but uncooperative, grumpy, pretentious, weak memory for numbers.\n\nThus we can argue C is better overall.\n\nThus vote for Candidate C.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: state recommendation for C, reference Agent 1's reliability and teamwork notes, and earlier discussion about B's concerns, and mention C's strengths and concerns, and why C outweighs B.\n\nProceed."}
